task_spec.prompt:
Migrate src/app.py to use a proper ItemRepository instead of the hardcoded empty list.

1. Create src/repository.py:
   class ItemRepository:
       def __init__(self):
           self._items: dict[int, dict] = {}
           self._next_id: int = 1
       def list_all(self) -> list[dict]: return list(self._items.values())
       def create(self, name: str) -> dict: ...
       def get(self, item_id: int) -> dict | None: ...
       def delete(self, item_id: int) -> bool: ...

2. Update src/app.py to:
   - Import ItemRepository
   - Create module-level repo = ItemRepository()
   - Change GET /items to: return {"items": repo.list_all()}

The original test (GET /items returns {"items": []}) must still pass because repo starts empty.
Add tests/test_repository.py testing the ItemRepository directly.
